  "_why": "The 2026-09-06 sandbox run surfaced Orca-only keys (activate_chamber_temp_control, chamber_minimal_temperature) sitting in every filament preset. SuperSlicer reports them as unknown settings on load. They are authored for Orca in the master and were reaching the SuperSlicer artefacts unfiltered because, unlike the PrusaSlicer path, there was no option list to filter against.",
